  "note": "Much weather talk uses fare: Fa caldo, Fa freddo, Fa bel tempo. Rain and snow are verbs: piove, nevica. With seasons use in: in primavera, in estate, in autunno, in inverno. To go to the seaside is andare al mare; to the mountains, andare in montagna.",
